 26-09-24T12:45:00-07:00@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Roundup is the most widely used weedkiller in the world — an
 d the subject of one of the largest mass torts in American history. Bayer 
 has committed billions to settlements\, and this June the Supreme Court ha
 nded the company a landmark win in Monsanto v. Durnell. Behind the headlin
 es is the machinery that decided who won and lost: a single federal judge 
 in San Francisco steering tens of thousands of consolidated cases\, bellwe
 ther trials\, courtroom battles over the science and the experts\, a faile
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/inside-mass-tor
 t-litigation-a-lunch-talk-with-leading-plaintiffs-lawyers/\nLast synced: 2
 026-09-15 10:30 PDT
