SUMMARY:[Stanford Law] What is Plaintiffs’ Law? Speaker + Social
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T203000
DTSTAMP:20260915T173023Z
UID:stanford_campus-law-10003305-1790276400-1790281800@law.stanford.edu-20
 26-09-24T19:00:00-07:00@local-events
DESCRIPTION:RSVP to meet the members of the Plaintiffs’ Law Association 
 over dinner! You’ll hear from a Stanford alum who made her career in the
  plaintiffs’ bar about what it is and why you should consider it. Stick 
 around to ask current students why they want to do the same (and just to m
